  "document": "Ferdinand, Prince of Solms-Braunfels\nFerdinand Wilhelm Ernst, 2nd Prince of Solms- Braunfels( 8 February 1721 in Braunfels – 2 October 1783, ibid.) was the second Prince of Solms- Braunfels. He was the son of Frederick William, Prince of Solms- Braunfels( 1696 – 1761) by his first wife Princess Magdalena Henrietta of Nassau- Weilburg( 1691 – 1725)."
